Description: Check whether a package is ready for submission to the 'rOpenSci'
    peer review system ('rOpenSci' authors (2026) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.2553043>
    "'rOpenSci' Packages: Development, Maintenance, and Peer Review").
    Incorporates the 'goodpractice' package and many additional checks,
    including aspects related to maintenance of online public code
    repositories.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://docs.ropensci.org/pkgcheck/,
        https://github.com/ropensci-review-tools/pkgcheck
BugReports: https://github.com/ropensci-review-tools/pkgcheck/issues
